<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Explore India - Travel Website</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #f5f7fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #1e3a5f;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #142840;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffd166;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.5), rgba(0,0,0,.5)),
                        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524492412937-b28074a5d7da?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80");
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            color: white;
            padding: 100px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        section {
            padding: 50px 10%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        section h2 {
            color: #1e3a5f;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            width: 280px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #1e3a5f;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .contact {
            background: #eaf0f6;
        }

        footer {
            background: #142840;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 8px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Explore India</h1>
    <p>Your guide to amazing destinations</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About Us</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
</nav>

<section id="home" class="hero">
    <h2>Welcome to Explore India</h2>
    <p>Discover beautiful destinations, culture, history and unforgettable experiences.</p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
        Explore India is a travel website designed to help visitors discover
        some of the most beautiful and interesting destinations in India.
        Our website provides useful information about destinations and helps
        travelers plan memorable journeys.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Beautiful Beaches</h3>
            <p>Discover relaxing beaches and coastal destinations across India.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Historic Temples</h3>
            <p>Explore India's ancient temples, architecture and cultural heritage.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Adventure</h3>
            <p>Find exciting destinations for trekking, sightseeing and adventure.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>
        Explore India was created to make travel planning simple and enjoyable.
        We introduce travelers to interesting destinations, cultural landmarks,
        beaches and adventure locations throughout India.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions or suggestions, feel free to contact us.</p>
    <br>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> exploreindia@example.com</p>
    <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 98765 43210</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Explore India. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
